WEBVTT

01:33.141 --> 01:35.322
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:35.376 --> 01:37.830
(Adapted from the novel "A City, Waiting for You" by Jiuyuexi)

01:37.916 --> 01:40.643
(Episode 9)

03:03.500 --> 03:05.667
(Honorably discharged)

03:12.201 --> 03:14.160
-Fall in line. -Yes, madam.

03:24.201 --> 03:26.160
Half turn to the left. Turn!

03:30.041 --> 03:31.041
Recite.

03:31.081 --> 03:32.801
Yancheng Fire and Rescue Oath.

03:33.801 --> 03:36.041
Together with fellow firefighters,

03:36.880 --> 03:39.761
we will safeguard the peace of our home.

03:40.481 --> 03:43.641
Ready to brave fire and water,

03:44.000 --> 03:45.696
putting people above all,

03:45.720 --> 03:48.081
never deterring.

03:48.361 --> 03:50.000
This our duty.

03:50.160 --> 03:52.361
We will keep our watch through the night.

03:52.680 --> 03:54.280
The years will be eventful.

03:54.400 --> 03:56.801
Engraved with illustrious feats,

03:56.880 --> 03:58.680
our footsteps shall be light.

03:58.880 --> 04:01.241
We will be stoic and proud.

04:01.400 --> 04:03.961
Never forgetting our roots,

04:04.081 --> 04:06.680
answering the needs of the people.

04:07.120 --> 04:08.840
Our responsibility is to protect our land.

04:09.000 --> 04:10.720
We fear no hardship.

04:10.840 --> 04:12.481
We are always at the ready.

04:12.680 --> 04:14.280
We will do everything we can.

04:14.481 --> 04:16.120
The water dragon will subdue the fire

04:16.440 --> 04:18.720
and stop buildings from collapsing.

04:18.881 --> 04:20.576
We will go into the fire

04:20.600 --> 04:23.081
to save lives from burning.

04:24.681 --> 04:25.881
Salute!

04:46.561 --> 04:47.561
Sir.

04:50.881 --> 04:52.160
Come visit us often.

04:55.160 --> 04:56.160
Sir.

04:58.681 --> 05:00.360
I haven't yet become your best soldier.

05:00.881 --> 05:01.961
Please don't go.

05:02.600 --> 05:03.920
I will train hard.

05:07.280 --> 05:08.441
I believe in you.

05:09.720 --> 05:11.961
You're surely become an outstanding firefighter.

05:13.561 --> 05:14.840
-Instructor. -That's enough.

05:14.961 --> 05:16.627
Da Peng. Don't be like that.

05:16.881 --> 05:18.081
You're making it harder for Instructor Suo.

05:25.360 --> 05:26.360
Take care.

05:28.360 --> 05:29.360
Sir.

05:30.280 --> 05:31.321
When you are free,

05:32.081 --> 05:33.081
do come back and see us.

06:17.600 --> 06:18.720
My job there will be hectic.

06:19.840 --> 06:20.840
And it's far from here.

06:22.240 --> 06:23.641
Even if I were to say I'd come back,

06:24.201 --> 06:25.521
I can't be sure to fulfill it.

06:29.280 --> 06:30.321
So I'll just say one thing.

06:33.160 --> 06:34.521
Be safe.

06:44.081 --> 06:45.201
I really wish I could

06:46.001 --> 06:47.201
go on another mission with Instructor Suo.

06:47.600 --> 06:48.840
Just shut it.

06:53.920 --> 06:55.896
(An office building in Xi Shi Center, Hengfang Road is on fire.)

06:55.920 --> 06:57.040
You jinxed it!

06:57.360 --> 06:59.121
(Two water trucks, two foam trucks.)

07:00.160 --> 07:02.761
(An office building in Xi Shi Center, Hengfang Road is on fire.)

07:03.441 --> 07:05.360
(Two water trucks, two foam trucks.)

07:45.121 --> 07:47.001
-Stay safe! -We will!

10:17.240 --> 10:18.240
Suo Jun.

10:37.081 --> 10:39.120
The chief sent a car to get me.

10:39.441 --> 10:41.520
The traffic was bad so it took longer.

10:42.801 --> 10:44.000
Thank goodness I made it.

10:49.281 --> 10:50.281
Why did you come?

10:54.000 --> 10:55.240
I came to bring you home.

10:58.961 --> 10:59.961
I'm sorry.

11:02.360 --> 11:03.520
Dummy.

11:05.441 --> 11:06.561
It's okay as you're home.

11:10.201 --> 11:11.201
This time,

11:11.840 --> 11:14.081
you finally kept your promise to me.

11:16.441 --> 11:17.561
Let's go home.

11:39.081 --> 11:41.561
Any news about the men you've met?

11:45.600 --> 11:46.815
Let me think some more.

11:46.840 --> 11:48.561
Just give me a name.

11:49.760 --> 11:50.760
Qin Qin.

11:51.000 --> 11:52.081
Right now,

11:52.240 --> 11:54.360
you're at the ripe age to date.

11:54.441 --> 11:56.120
I left the photos at the condo.

11:56.161 --> 11:57.281
I'll go back and take a look.

11:58.281 --> 11:59.336
I have extra copies here.

11:59.360 --> 12:00.360
Pour yourself tea.

12:07.801 --> 12:08.801
First impression.

12:09.720 --> 12:11.041
Let's see if your intuition is good.

12:19.880 --> 12:20.880
Let me see.

12:23.681 --> 12:24.681
Jiang Yu.

12:27.081 --> 12:28.921
You and I share the same taste.

12:29.201 --> 12:30.201
I also think

12:30.921 --> 12:32.561
this young man is pretty good.

12:34.120 --> 12:35.120
Okay.

12:36.041 --> 12:38.336
I'll send your WeChat contact to his mother.

12:38.360 --> 12:39.360
Remember.

12:39.401 --> 12:40.480
Reply if he contacts you.

12:43.360 --> 12:44.360
I'll go upstairs.

12:47.081 --> 12:48.081
Wait.

12:48.720 --> 12:50.281
Take the photo.

13:13.520 --> 13:14.520
High-grade tea leaves.

13:14.720 --> 13:17.000
Keep this for yourself, sir.

13:20.081 --> 13:22.120
I'm gifting it to you.

13:22.240 --> 13:23.561
You don't want it?

13:23.921 --> 13:25.801
Did the sun rise up

13:26.201 --> 13:28.240
from the west today?

13:32.921 --> 13:35.600
I understand. You're not happy.

13:37.041 --> 13:38.640
Suo Jun was reassigned.

13:38.681 --> 13:41.240
Well, there was no better option.

13:41.520 --> 13:42.681
He's injured.

13:43.000 --> 13:44.681
You know his condition.

13:46.801 --> 13:48.321
I will follow the arrangements.

13:51.041 --> 13:53.561
You and Suo Jun

13:53.880 --> 13:57.000
lived, ate and worked together

13:57.321 --> 13:58.600
for almost eight years, right?

13:59.240 --> 14:01.000
Your friendship

14:01.240 --> 14:02.681
and camaraderie

14:02.760 --> 14:04.240
cannot be replaced.

14:04.640 --> 14:06.681
However, this is the nature of the job.

14:06.880 --> 14:09.017
In iron-clad barracks with ever-moving soldiers,

14:09.041 --> 14:10.840
there is no position

14:10.880 --> 14:13.281
that allows good friends

14:13.480 --> 14:15.760
to work together forever.

14:16.281 --> 14:17.281
Am I right?

14:18.161 --> 14:20.681
I hope you'll get over this incident.

14:21.240 --> 14:23.081
Don't let it affect your future works.

14:24.161 --> 14:25.161
Understood.

14:25.640 --> 14:26.640
Rest assured, sir.

14:27.081 --> 14:28.120
I won't let it affect my work.

14:28.961 --> 14:31.321
Then show me your teeth.

14:34.880 --> 14:36.561
There's the handsome young man.

14:54.921 --> 14:56.921
Be good, you hear?

15:28.401 --> 15:29.401
Finished.

15:31.961 --> 15:33.360
All right, what's your critique?

15:33.480 --> 15:34.480
Any critique?

15:36.201 --> 15:37.201
Lead them back.

15:37.441 --> 15:38.441
Okay.

15:43.880 --> 15:45.120
All present, listen to my command.

15:45.240 --> 15:46.480
All, look to the right.

15:48.401 --> 15:49.401
Look forward.

15:50.840 --> 15:52.201
Not bad. You guys did well.

15:52.880 --> 15:54.921
All present, turn right.

15:55.760 --> 15:57.081
Squad leaders, take your squads back.

16:05.041 --> 16:06.081
Go, move in line.

17:17.841 --> 17:18.841
Dr. Xu.

17:19.760 --> 17:21.000
Dr. Xu, something happened.

17:21.441 --> 17:24.016
Chen Min is awake, but she's very distraught.

17:24.040 --> 17:25.881
She is not cooperating with us and said it's too painful.

17:26.201 --> 17:28.000
-What does she want then? -To kill herself.

17:28.280 --> 17:29.280
What?

17:35.760 --> 17:37.921
-Get out! -Please calm down.

17:38.040 --> 17:39.641
-Listen to... -Get out!

17:39.961 --> 17:40.976
Please stop.

17:41.000 --> 17:42.240
Leave, all of you!

17:43.480 --> 17:44.841
Calm down.

17:47.080 --> 17:48.161
Calm down!

17:48.240 --> 17:50.240
Min Min, my dear Min Min.

17:51.520 --> 17:52.520
Doctor.

17:52.881 --> 17:53.881
We're so sorry.

17:54.080 --> 17:55.201
We'll talk to her.

17:55.961 --> 17:57.040
Sorry for the trouble.

17:57.201 --> 17:58.720
-It's okay. -Sorry for the trouble.

17:59.240 --> 18:00.441
So sorry.

18:02.401 --> 18:03.401
Min.

18:04.240 --> 18:05.240
It's all right.

18:07.240 --> 18:08.961
Officer, is there anyone trapped upstairs?

18:09.161 --> 18:10.937
We've already evacuated the upstairs residents.

18:10.961 --> 18:11.961
Noted.

18:13.760 --> 18:15.000
Jun Ping, what's the reading?

18:15.240 --> 18:16.240
It's within the safe limit.

18:16.441 --> 18:17.736
Jiang, break down the door.

18:17.760 --> 18:18.760
Got it.

18:23.320 --> 18:24.976
Captain, we're heading in.

18:25.000 --> 18:26.361
Disperse the crowd. Get the fire under control.

18:30.280 --> 18:31.280
Quickly.

18:35.121 --> 18:36.496
Mister. Mister?

18:36.520 --> 18:37.496
Can you hear me?

18:37.520 --> 18:38.857
Wake up, mister.

18:38.881 --> 18:39.881
Come, give me a hand.

18:40.800 --> 18:41.841
Onto my back.

18:43.881 --> 18:44.881
Okay.

18:45.921 --> 18:46.921
Stretcher!

18:47.040 --> 18:49.280
-Get the stretcher! -Quick, stretcher!

18:51.040 --> 18:52.040
Here.

18:52.161 --> 18:53.161
Help me out.

18:56.641 --> 18:57.641
Here.

19:03.280 --> 19:04.841
Wake up.

19:05.240 --> 19:06.240
Wake up.

19:16.560 --> 19:17.881
You're okay, mister.

19:18.000 --> 19:19.320
You're safe now. Don't worry.

19:21.361 --> 19:22.361
What...

19:23.000 --> 19:24.601
Did you save me?

19:24.800 --> 19:25.800
Yes.

19:26.121 --> 19:27.121
Let's take you to the hospital.

19:30.881 --> 19:31.881
Come.

19:32.480 --> 19:33.480
Sit up.

19:33.520 --> 19:34.520
Slowly.

19:38.601 --> 19:40.881
Why did you save me?

19:42.961 --> 19:46.080
Why did you stop me from dying?

19:51.161 --> 19:53.800
Why did you stop me from dying?

20:00.320 --> 20:02.453
-It's okay. -Yang.

20:02.560 --> 20:03.601
It's okay.

20:06.280 --> 20:08.601
Why did you stop me from dying?

20:15.720 --> 20:18.560
Why did you stop me from dying?

20:23.720 --> 20:24.720
Doctor.

20:25.000 --> 20:26.000
Sorry about that.

20:26.201 --> 20:27.280
We caused trouble for you.

20:27.361 --> 20:28.361
So sorry.

20:28.641 --> 20:29.641
Sir, ma'am.

20:29.841 --> 20:32.280
Let me talk to Chen Min alone.

20:40.681 --> 20:43.441
Chen Min, I hope you can get your emotions under control.

20:43.601 --> 20:44.961
You can save your breath.

20:46.401 --> 20:48.121
It's better for me to just die.

20:48.240 --> 20:49.601
I don't want to burden my parents.

20:50.401 --> 20:52.121
And I won't have to suffer anymore.

20:54.361 --> 20:55.800
I know where you're coming from.

20:56.560 --> 20:58.441
But if you feel bad about being a burden to your parents,

20:59.161 --> 21:01.016
I can assure you.

21:01.040 --> 21:03.401
Parents are the last people on earth who would think their child is a burden.

21:03.881 --> 21:05.377
But if it's the pain you're worried about,

21:05.401 --> 21:07.320
I can tell give you my word as a doctor

21:07.480 --> 21:09.520
that we'll do our best to minimize the pain.

21:09.881 --> 21:11.056
So please have more courage.

21:11.080 --> 21:12.080
Courage?

21:12.480 --> 21:13.520
How am I supposed to be brave?

21:14.040 --> 21:15.520
I'm the one whose face got ruined.

21:15.560 --> 21:16.681
Not you.

21:17.480 --> 21:19.841
I rather die than live like this.

21:20.320 --> 21:21.760
There's no better way for me.

21:22.161 --> 21:24.976
Who would want to see my face on broadcasts?

21:25.000 --> 21:27.240
I will never be able to find love again.

21:27.480 --> 21:28.937
So don't tell me what I should do!

21:28.961 --> 21:30.216
-Get out! -Calm down.

21:30.240 --> 21:33.177
I said, get out!

21:33.201 --> 21:35.177
-Don't touch me. Get out! -Okay.

21:35.201 --> 21:36.601
I won't touch you, okay?

21:37.040 --> 21:38.097
Dr. Yang, let's leave first.

21:38.121 --> 21:39.441
Give her some time to calm down.

21:41.601 --> 21:43.657
Okay, calm down. We'll leave.

21:43.681 --> 21:44.897
I said those things out of concern.

21:44.921 --> 21:46.897
We know. She's just not in the right frame of mind.

21:46.921 --> 21:47.921
Don't let it bother you.

22:10.720 --> 22:11.800
Go away.

22:12.000 --> 22:13.280
Leave me alone.

22:13.320 --> 22:15.401
You're the one with the scarred face.

22:15.520 --> 22:17.921
You'd never understand what I'm feeling.

22:18.441 --> 22:21.601
Do you think you're the only one who got unlucky.

22:22.961 --> 22:23.961
You know what?

22:24.681 --> 22:26.401
The firefighter who saved you

22:26.881 --> 22:27.881
suffered burns on his face.

22:29.240 --> 22:30.720
His arm sustained permanent damage.

22:31.441 --> 22:33.080
He is no longer fit to be dispatched

22:33.560 --> 22:34.720
and was made to retire.

22:36.361 --> 22:38.320
The person he risked his life to rescue

22:39.480 --> 22:41.240
now wishes to die.

22:42.641 --> 22:44.240
So the sacrifice he made

22:44.401 --> 22:45.720
became a joke.

23:13.240 --> 23:14.240
Yang Chi.

23:15.280 --> 23:16.280
Captain.

23:17.961 --> 23:20.480
Don't keep any misgivings to yourself.

23:22.040 --> 23:23.040
I'm fine.

23:24.280 --> 23:26.681
We often got rebuked last time.

23:27.000 --> 23:28.641
When the Curtain City caught fire,

23:28.681 --> 23:30.056
the roof caved in.

23:30.080 --> 23:31.720
But people still criticized us, saying

23:31.760 --> 23:34.361
that we were cowards for not rushing in.

23:35.800 --> 23:37.080
You said this all the time.

23:37.520 --> 23:40.361
In life, misunderstandings outnumber understanding.

23:40.480 --> 23:41.760
It's normal for people to misunderstand.

23:42.280 --> 23:43.760
Well, I'll carry on with my work.

23:48.800 --> 23:50.800
How is the firefighter now?

23:53.520 --> 23:55.441
He remains as his beloved's fiance,

23:55.961 --> 23:57.201
his parents' son.

23:58.441 --> 23:59.681
Those that truly love him

24:00.320 --> 24:02.401
will not mind how he looks.

24:03.201 --> 24:04.280
Dr. Xu.

24:07.161 --> 24:08.800
I'm really scared.

24:09.361 --> 24:10.720
So scared.

24:19.560 --> 24:21.800
You were successfully rescued.

24:22.641 --> 24:24.320
So please do your best to live.

24:24.881 --> 24:26.280
Put your bet on a good outcome.

24:27.161 --> 24:28.841
What if it's a bad one?

24:29.320 --> 24:30.361
How bad can it be?

24:31.121 --> 24:33.161
Nothing is worse than death.

24:33.681 --> 24:34.921
Because to die

24:36.090 --> 24:38.330
means there is no longer any possibility.

24:39.681 --> 24:41.641
I know what you're saying.

24:41.921 --> 24:44.480
I also know that I should be strong.

24:44.601 --> 24:47.161
I should face it with courage.

24:47.361 --> 24:48.361
But...

24:48.681 --> 24:51.641
But I really can't take it.

24:52.000 --> 24:54.121
I can't accept it.

24:55.520 --> 24:57.361
You don't have to.

24:57.921 --> 25:00.080
We don't have to face hardship with a smile.

25:00.520 --> 25:02.760
Let alone calmly accept it.

25:03.280 --> 25:05.161
It doesn't stop you from moving forward.

25:05.881 --> 25:06.921
One day,

25:07.881 --> 25:09.401
while you tread forward, you'll realize

25:10.641 --> 25:11.641
that some hardships

25:12.361 --> 25:13.560
still remain in the corner.

25:14.280 --> 25:15.641
But they're no longer important.

25:17.161 --> 25:18.201
Because you

25:20.000 --> 25:21.681
have started a new life.

25:40.080 --> 25:41.641
Chen Min agreed to have the surgery?

25:42.361 --> 25:43.681
That's right.

25:44.201 --> 25:46.040
Dr. Xu managed to persuade her?

25:46.240 --> 25:47.520
What did she say?

25:47.841 --> 25:49.201
Who knows?

25:49.320 --> 25:52.560
Dr. Xu is truly a curiosity of the hospital.

25:59.841 --> 26:00.841
Bye, everyone.

26:01.841 --> 26:02.841
You girls chat.

26:07.881 --> 26:09.256
-Let's go. -Work is done.

26:09.280 --> 26:10.817
Whatever. Let's just go.

26:10.841 --> 26:12.881
-Work is done. -Hurry up.

27:13.240 --> 27:14.240
Dr. Xu.

27:42.560 --> 27:43.560
(Please enter.)

28:00.520 --> 28:01.520
Mom.

28:01.841 --> 28:03.040
Mom, we're back.

28:03.560 --> 28:04.560
Yan Chen.

28:04.921 --> 28:06.320
I have something to ask you.

28:14.841 --> 28:16.240
What's this about?

28:27.625 --> 28:28.812
(Payment of fine. Transaction successful)

28:34.560 --> 28:35.560
Mom.

28:35.601 --> 28:36.881
I'm a grown adult.

28:37.441 --> 28:38.841
Why are you still checking my balance?

28:40.441 --> 28:41.480
If I didn't check,

28:43.161 --> 28:46.961
I wouldn't have known about the 100,000 fine.

28:47.720 --> 28:48.961
The thing that worries your dad and I most

28:49.000 --> 28:50.441
is that you two might go astray.

28:50.921 --> 28:52.520
We don't ever want to see

28:53.201 --> 28:55.361
you two doing anything immoral.

28:56.720 --> 28:58.080
Explain it to me.

29:03.121 --> 29:05.040
I have a friend.

29:07.361 --> 29:08.921
He got arrested for selling fake goods.

29:10.201 --> 29:11.560
I helped him pay for the fine.

29:22.560 --> 29:23.560
I believe you.

29:25.441 --> 29:26.441
Sit down.

29:28.560 --> 29:29.560
Come.

29:29.601 --> 29:30.601
Qin Qin.

29:31.000 --> 29:32.000
You sit here.

29:35.760 --> 29:38.720
Have you met up with Jiang Yu?

29:38.841 --> 29:40.841
Mom, I've been quite busy with work.

29:41.681 --> 29:43.240
You always say you're busy.

29:43.480 --> 29:45.161
You only come home when I tell you to.

29:45.441 --> 29:48.240
I could talk to the associate dean

29:48.320 --> 29:49.681
about giving you

29:50.201 --> 29:52.417
a less taxing job.

29:52.441 --> 29:53.441
How about that?

29:53.800 --> 29:55.841
The guy tried to ask you out.

29:55.921 --> 29:57.161
But you're always busy.

29:57.401 --> 29:59.201
What if he stops asking?

29:59.240 --> 30:00.280
This time,

30:00.480 --> 30:01.720
you be proactive.

30:02.040 --> 30:03.161
You ask him out.

30:03.280 --> 30:04.280
Do it now.

30:04.881 --> 30:05.881
Text him.

30:28.480 --> 30:29.480
I sent it.

30:32.080 --> 30:34.040
It's okay to be restrained.

30:34.240 --> 30:36.320
But Jiang Yu's family and ours

30:36.681 --> 30:38.097
are of similar status.

30:38.121 --> 30:39.480
So,

30:40.280 --> 30:41.921
there's no need to be so formal.

30:42.520 --> 30:44.441
All right, you may go.

30:45.040 --> 30:46.361
I'll be upstairs.

31:02.480 --> 31:03.480
Out with it.

31:04.441 --> 31:06.881
What was the money really for?

31:08.320 --> 31:09.361
Does it

31:10.520 --> 31:12.000
have anything to do with the Song guy?

31:14.480 --> 31:17.681
You two dared to do such a thing under my nose.

31:20.201 --> 31:22.080
Are you trying to be their Cupid?

31:24.560 --> 31:25.560
Mom.

31:26.280 --> 31:27.736
I wasn't trying to help them.

31:27.760 --> 31:29.161
Nevertheless, you shouldn't have helped her.

31:36.520 --> 31:38.641
You've learned to lie now.

32:01.480 --> 32:02.480
Welcome.

32:09.681 --> 32:11.240
-Please enjoy. -Thanks.

32:26.240 --> 32:27.641
-Hello. -Hello.

32:28.240 --> 32:29.240
Take a seat.

32:29.961 --> 32:31.536
I'm sorry. I hope I'm not late.

32:31.560 --> 32:33.480
No, I just got here myself.

32:34.401 --> 32:35.520
What would you like to drink?

32:35.841 --> 32:36.841
Ice Americano.

32:36.961 --> 32:38.080
Hello.

32:38.201 --> 32:39.617
-One ice Americano. -Okay.

32:39.641 --> 32:40.776
And a glass of water, thanks.

32:40.800 --> 32:41.800
Sure.

32:48.361 --> 32:50.720
So, you're a surgeon?

32:52.320 --> 32:53.320
Yes.

32:54.080 --> 32:56.441
You must be quite busy then.

32:57.361 --> 32:59.000
-Water for you. -Thanks.

32:59.441 --> 33:00.441
It's not too bad.

33:05.080 --> 33:08.800
I reckon it's quite tiring being a doctor.

33:24.961 --> 33:26.760
Do you get two consecutive days off?

33:27.121 --> 33:28.121
We do.

33:29.080 --> 33:31.337
Then, how come you couldn't make it

33:31.361 --> 33:33.800
to the date we set last week?

33:36.361 --> 33:37.441
I'm in the Emergency Department.

33:38.520 --> 33:39.520
We go by shifts.

33:41.961 --> 33:44.361
-Your ice Americano. Enjoy. -Thanks.

34:08.480 --> 34:09.600
You like this music?

34:10.281 --> 34:12.361
-Yes. -So do I.

34:12.761 --> 34:13.761
So,

34:14.000 --> 34:18.520
I've seen many versions of the "Swan Lake" world tour.

34:18.841 --> 34:19.841
Really?

34:19.961 --> 34:22.056
Which cast did you see?

34:22.080 --> 34:26.136
Because they alternate between Team A and Team B,

34:26.160 --> 34:28.000
-I watched the one I... -Excuse me.

34:41.250 --> 34:42.250
What's the matter?

34:46.120 --> 34:47.721
Something came up at the hospital.

34:48.200 --> 34:49.241
I have to go.

34:50.520 --> 34:51.721
I'm really sorry.

34:52.761 --> 34:53.761
Take care.

34:56.420 --> 34:59.320
(I've transferred the money. Please check. Thanks)

35:11.186 --> 35:13.792
(What are you doing)

35:22.260 --> 35:26.160
(You're welcome)

35:34.121 --> 35:36.674
(When you have the time, I wish to)

35:49.697 --> 35:53.816
(Shouldn't you treat me to a meal as thanks)

36:10.155 --> 36:13.806
(Okay. What would you like to eat)

36:30.160 --> 36:31.297
That boy, Suo Jun.

36:31.321 --> 36:32.520
He left just like that.

36:32.841 --> 36:35.241
I really feel bad for him.

36:36.441 --> 36:37.441
He's tough.

36:37.921 --> 36:38.921
He'll get through it.

36:41.640 --> 36:43.016
But I do agree with what he said

36:43.040 --> 36:45.761
before he left.

36:46.160 --> 36:49.600
You really should have a life outside of work.

36:51.921 --> 36:53.761
But I understand.

36:54.241 --> 36:57.281
You're still thinking of Xu Qin, aren't you?

37:07.160 --> 37:08.721
Mrs. He.

37:08.801 --> 37:09.961
Don't run.

37:15.120 --> 37:16.120
Miao.

37:18.200 --> 37:20.217
-Yan is back? -Mrs. He.

37:20.241 --> 37:21.976
You brought so much good food.

37:22.000 --> 37:24.321
You have to try these cured meat from my hometown.

37:25.120 --> 37:27.361
Lovely. Let me serve them on a platter.

37:27.480 --> 37:29.377
There's no rush. I'll leave it all with you if you can't find a plate.

37:29.401 --> 37:30.640
That won't do.

37:34.361 --> 37:35.361
Yan.

37:35.520 --> 37:37.640
How's everything? Have you gotten yourself a girlfriend?

37:38.801 --> 37:39.801
Not yet.

37:40.401 --> 37:42.576
No wonder your aunt is anxious.

37:42.600 --> 37:44.160
You've got great qualifications.

37:44.841 --> 37:45.841
Tell me.

37:45.921 --> 37:47.680
What type of girl are you looking for?

37:48.040 --> 37:49.640
Do you like someone outgoing

37:49.761 --> 37:51.200
or someone more reserved?

37:51.560 --> 37:52.560
Dong Mei.

37:53.401 --> 37:55.450
This is freshly made chili sauce from Zhai's family home.

37:55.475 --> 37:57.401
You have to try it. It's really fragrant.

37:57.721 --> 37:59.096
I already smell it.

37:59.120 --> 38:00.961
It must be good mixed with rice.

38:01.680 --> 38:03.640
Look how nice the boy is.

38:03.721 --> 38:05.000
He helps out with menial work.

38:06.160 --> 38:08.520
Not like my Kang Kang, who only knows to play games.

38:08.761 --> 38:11.000
Oh, hush. Kang Kang is good, too.

38:11.721 --> 38:13.921
I better go back. I've got stew cooking.

38:14.321 --> 38:15.640
Yan, come visit when you're free.

38:26.040 --> 38:27.441
What was I talking about just now?

38:30.480 --> 38:32.520
Right, I was saying.

38:32.761 --> 38:35.401
Nowadays, the society thinks differently.

38:35.520 --> 38:38.441
It's not like before when you should marry within your own class.

38:39.321 --> 38:40.321
Aunt.

38:41.600 --> 38:42.721
Just speak your mind.

38:47.000 --> 38:48.401
What I mean is,

38:49.000 --> 38:50.401
although it's no longer encouraged,

38:50.721 --> 38:54.640
old sayings still hold true in some ways.

38:55.160 --> 38:56.697
When the family status is too different,

38:56.721 --> 38:58.401
it's hard to be happy together.

38:58.801 --> 39:02.603
Here's the thing. Right now, it's not about your compatibility.

39:02.640 --> 39:04.777
Nor whether you two should date or not.

39:04.801 --> 39:06.401
This is about two families.

39:06.680 --> 39:08.120
-Say, if... -I get it.

39:09.321 --> 39:10.361
You don't have to worry.

39:10.640 --> 39:11.640
I know what to do.

39:13.361 --> 39:14.361
Where's Uncle?

39:16.000 --> 39:19.160
Your uncle found a recipe for stinky mandarin fish online.

39:19.200 --> 39:20.801
He wanted to make it for you.

39:21.640 --> 39:22.937
So he went out to buy fish.

39:22.961 --> 39:24.520
He should be back by now.

39:27.640 --> 39:28.817
Anyway, about what I said,

39:28.841 --> 39:30.120
I hope you take it to heart.

39:32.160 --> 39:33.401
Don't make things hard for yourself.

39:37.600 --> 39:39.560
I'm sure the food in the hospital is drab.

39:40.881 --> 39:41.881
Eat more.

39:44.200 --> 39:45.761
The food there is pretty good.

39:46.881 --> 39:47.881
That's enough, Mom.

39:48.000 --> 39:49.040
You eat.

39:52.841 --> 39:54.040
Your dark eye circles are showing.

39:55.520 --> 39:57.680
You met with Jiang Yu?

39:59.160 --> 40:01.080
We exchanged texts and met for coffee.

40:01.261 --> 40:03.500
But something came up in the hospital so I left early.

40:03.961 --> 40:05.080
That busy, huh?

40:07.680 --> 40:09.000
I think you're more suited

40:09.640 --> 40:12.000
to do research work in a university.

40:13.000 --> 40:14.560
I'll get you a new job.

40:15.881 --> 40:17.560
I'm quite happy with where I am now.

40:17.721 --> 40:18.801
What's there to be happy about?

40:19.040 --> 40:20.200
You're getting skinnier.

40:21.200 --> 40:22.401
It's the same with your brother.

40:22.881 --> 40:24.761
I introduced so many nice ladies to him,

40:24.841 --> 40:26.200
but he wasn't interested in any.

40:27.000 --> 40:28.417
I don't know how you guys think.

40:28.441 --> 40:30.160
Getting married early is a good thing.

40:33.600 --> 40:34.600
Mom.

40:35.640 --> 40:36.761
There's a guy.

40:37.441 --> 40:38.520
I'm interested in.

40:42.040 --> 40:43.040
I suppose

40:43.600 --> 40:44.640
you could say I like him.

40:45.841 --> 40:46.841
Jiang Yu?

40:47.680 --> 40:48.680
No.

40:49.600 --> 40:50.640
Then from which family?

41:05.441 --> 41:06.480
Previously,

41:07.321 --> 41:09.000
when I was studying abroad,

41:10.761 --> 41:14.241
did you receive any letter addressed to me?

41:19.401 --> 41:20.401
What?

41:24.881 --> 41:25.881
It's nothing.

41:29.520 --> 41:30.520
I'm full.

41:30.841 --> 41:31.841
I'll leave now.

41:31.921 --> 41:33.040
I have work tomorrow.

41:36.441 --> 41:37.441
Qin Qin.

41:39.881 --> 41:41.200
Don't make me

41:42.961 --> 41:44.361
become the bad guy again.
